  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Implement the creation of a LDPCv when versioning is 'turned on' for a LDPR (thereby becoming a LDPRv).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "The LDPCv must not be a child of the LDPRv",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "It must be a LDPC ( ",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "https://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#LDPC"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "https://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#LDPC",
           "type": "text"
          },
          {
           "text": " )",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "It must contain a relationship to its LDPRv",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "It must contain the mementos that are created.",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "If this is created when a resource is first created, then a memento must be created as well.  ",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "See this document for what REST ful interactions should look like in regards to LDPCv: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=90964507#Versioning/AuthorizationDesign-restRESTfulInteractions"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=90964507#Versioning/AuthorizationDesign-restRESTfulInteractions",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Note that somewhere in this process of creating a LDPCv  modeshape will need to be disabled from doing versioning.  Right now modeshape does the versioning via the 'fcr:versions' end point.  The 'fcr:versions' endpoint needs to represent this new LDPCv instead.   That might be part of another ticket.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
