  "description": "\n\n<p>Implement the creation of a LDPCv when versioning is 'turned on' for a LDPR (thereby becoming a LDPRv).</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>The LDPCv must not be a child of the LDPRv</li>\n\t<li>It must be a LDPC ( <a href=\"https://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#LDPC\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#LDPC</a> )</li>\n\t<li>It must contain a relationship to its LDPRv</li>\n\t<li>It must contain the mementos that are created.</li>\n\t<li>If this is created when a resource is first created, then a memento must be created as well.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>See this document for what REST ful interactions should look like in regards to LDPCv: <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=90964507#Versioning/AuthorizationDesign-restRESTfulInteractions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=90964507#Versioning/AuthorizationDesign-restRESTfulInteractions</a></p>\n\n<p>Note that somewhere in this process of creating a LDPCv  modeshape will need to be disabled from doing versioning.  Right now modeshape does the versioning via the 'fcr:versions' end point.  The 'fcr:versions' endpoint needs to represent this new LDPCv instead.   That might be part of another ticket.</p>",
